return {h=10,w=320,cr=75,hc=20,bh=70,gr="medium",eg={"ground"},st={65,105,60,60,70,95},ab={{72,0},{83,0},{128,1}},genus={en="Pig Monkey Pokémon",es="Pokémon Mono Cerdo",pt="Pokémon Macaco-porco"},flavor={en={[1]="Always furious and tenacious to boot. It will not abandon chasing its quarry until it is caught.",[2]="Always furious and tenacious to boot. It will not abandon chasing its quarry until it is caught.",[3]="It stops being angry only when nobody else is around. To view this moment is very difficult.",[4]="If approached while asleep, it may awaken and angrily give chase in a groggy state of semi-sleep.",[5]="It becomes wildly furious if it even senses someone looking at it. It chases anyone that meets its glare.",[6]="It will beat up anyone who makes it mad, even if it has to chase them until the end of the world.",[7]="When PRIMEAPE becomes furious, its blood circulation is boosted. In turn, its muscles are made even stronger. However, it also becomes much less intelligent at the same time.",[8]="When PRIMEAPE becomes furious, its blood circulation is boosted. In turn, its muscles are made even stronger. However, it also becomes much less intelligent at the same time.",[9]="When it becomes furious, its blood circulation becomes more robust, and its muscles are made stronger. But it also becomes much less intelligent.",[10]="It is always outrageously furious. If it gives chase, it will tenaciously track the target no matter how far.",[11]="Always furious and tenacious to boot. It will not abandon chasing its quarry until it catches up.",[12]="It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder.",[13]="It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder.",[14]="It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder.",[15]="If approached while asleep, it may awaken and angrily give chase in a groggy state of semi-sleep.",[1